      "value": "@{64873f159cf028090ce2c2e2|full_name} After testing several times, we found no changes depending on file format or file size.\n\nThe print camera worked normally during daytime hours in Japan, but when we tried it earlier (around 9:30 p.m. Japan time), it failed.\n\nAs others have said, it may be a problem with the time of day or region.\n\nThis is my first time reporting a bug, so I apologize if my report is inaccurate.",
