  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "There is a bug that prevents printing images that have been uploaded less than a day ago using the print function.\n\nWhen you try to print an image uploaded from the official VRChat website, a message saying “An error occurred while uploading the image!” or “Upload failed” appears, and the print fails.\n\nThe same issue occurs when printing using the print camera on the spot.\n\nSince this was a bug I noticed immediately after joining VRC+, I initially thought it might just be taking time for the VRC+ settings to take effect, but even after a month, the issue has not been resolved.\n\nNote that the number of prints has not reached the maximum limit.\n\nThe text may be incorrect due to the use of translation software.",
